      "reason": "Eligibility is specified with relevant study characteristics including population (adult CA), setting (out-of-hospital), interventions/comparators (mechanical vs manual compression), study type (peer-reviewed human studies), and study designs via inclusion/exclusion of specific document types (e.g., excluded case reports/reviews/letters/abstracts and non-eligible device categories)."
